cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the model, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BanG Dream! character voices: cross-lingual Qwen3-TTS fine-tuning code"
authors:
  - alias: starrydark
repository-code: "https://github.com/starryark/bangdream-tts"
url: "https://huggingface.co/starrydark/BanG_Dream_Qwen3_TTS"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "E9"
date-released: "2026-11-09"
abstract: >-
  Code for an unofficial, fan-made BanG Dream! (邦邦) character-voice text-to-speech model
  (49 voices, plus 25 opt-in BanG Dream! Our Notes voices) in Japanese,
  Mandarin Chinese and English: data build, a codec-calibrated speaker-identity probe, one
  shared Qwen3-TTS fine-tune with language ids, native replay and in-voice pseudo-Mandarin,
  per-voice RVC conversion for native Mandarin in the voices that stayed generic, and
  pre-registered evaluation decided by blind listening.
keywords:
  - text-to-speech
  - Qwen3-TTS
  - fine-tuning
  - character voice
  - BanG Dream
  - MyGO!!!!!
  - Ave Mujica
  - Mandarin TTS
  - multi-speaker TTS
  - cross-lingual TTS
  - RVC
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Qwen3-TTS Technical Report"
    authors:
      - name: "Qwen Team"
    journal: "arXiv preprint arXiv:2601.15621"
    year: 2026
